{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 39, :comments ["<b>Meheitabel daughter of Matred.</b> Like the sense of 'daughter of Anah, daughter of Zibeon,' or Scripture mentioned the name of her father and the name of her mother." "<b>Mei-zahav.</b> So is his name, and the Gaon [Saadia] said [it means] a refiner of gold, and others said it is an allusion to those who make gold from copper, and these are words of wind."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:47:08.332361594Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}